- Stronger checks are needed to ensure that the minimum number of Administrators and Users are present in all runs/checks, and that assertions are evaluated only in scenarios that satisfy the Emergency entry preconditions.

INCREMENTAL ANALYSIS:
R1: Satisfiable (but instances may be degenerate due to insufficient user/admin count)
R1R2: Satisfiable
R1R2R3: Satisfiable
assertR3_MutExScenario: Counterexample found, but due to degenerate instance (only one Admin/user)
Transition point analysis:
- The failure at assertR3_MutExScenario is not due to a contradiction in mutual exclusion logic, but because the model permits Emergency mode with insufficient Administrators/users, invalidating the scenario and assertion.

